    "body": "There are still a few missing.  \r\nAlso, in various places your changes made the lines longer than the 100 characters break limit.  \r\nPlease read https://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#source-formatting carefully and fix these too (but be very careful when doing so, line wrapping is not that easy).\r\nFinally, if it's your first contribution, you'd need to fill your name in the Acknowledgement section, to quote the [contribution guide](https://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#pull-requests):\r\n> Please add your name to the Acknowledgments section (search for <!-- ACKS) in your first pull request, even for trivial fixes. The names are sorted lexicographically.",
